>Flood quick card
Get to higher ground by a dry route.

Follow evacuation instructions. Never walk, cycle or drive through floodwater.
If trapped, move upstairs or to a higher safe place. In immediate danger call emergency services (UK: 999). Give your location and who needs help.
Leave wet electrical controls alone. Use confirmed safe drinking water.

